    dct:description "Evaluates only 3 regimes (wild-type, Picasso closed-loop, and open-loop null), omitting unilateral caudal eye rotation, lateral jaw/mouth translocation, GM6001 MMP inhibitor blockade (`eta_mmp = 0.04`), and a 2D (perturbation amplitude, MMP mobility) Procrustes morphospace sweep." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
